<title>CHINA: C.LYONNAIS LAUNCHES WARRANTS ON BANKING STOCKS.</title>
<headline>C.LYONNAIS LAUNCHES WARRANTS ON BANKING STOCKS.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd said it launched 1.38 billion American style call warrants on a basket of banking stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p> Bank of East Asia Ltd		    0.020 shrs</p>
<p> Wing Hang Bank Ltd			 0.008 shrs</p>
<p> Dao Heng Bank Group Ltd		  0.008 shrs</p>
<p> Ka Wah Bank Ltd			    0.040 shrs</p>
<p> Dah Sing Financial Holdings Ltd	0.008 shrs</p>
<p> Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE     HK$1.80	 PREMIUM	  12.32 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	HK$0.05785    GEARING	  3.66x</p>
<p> LAUNCH DATE	12.AUG.97     MIN EXER LOT   20,000</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	 12.JUN.98     LISTING	  HONG KONG</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT   HK$2.1176     PAYDATE	  03.SEPT.97</p>
<p> GOVERNING LAW    HONG KONG     LISTING DATE   01.SEPT.97</p>
<p> NOTE		 PHYSICAL OR CASH SETTLEMENT AT ISSUER'S</p>
<p>			DISCRETION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
